{"id":"method-function-matching","html":"<section class=\"contract\" id=\"contract\"><h2>什么时候用</h2><dl><dt>适合什么题</dt><dd>固定有理系数的根式一次式、一次式，或 x−c/x（c&gt;0）；右边可恒等配成该整体输入的至多二次多项式。</dd><dt>最后要得到什么</dt><dd>解析式、确定范围、恒等与覆盖证明。</dd><dt>要注意</dt><dd>恒等式在原关系的自然定义域内成立；同一整体输入的输出必须一致。x−c/x 只接受原分母排除 0，无额外禁取点。</dd></dl></section><section id=\"path\"><h2>解题步骤</h2><p class=\"muted\">按顺序做。标了条件的技能，只在题目符合那个条件时才用。</p><ol class=\"method-path\" aria-label=\"解题步骤\"><li id=\"recover\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><h3>配成整体输入的式子</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#recover\" aria-label=\"定位到配成整体输入的式子\">#</a></div><p>先展开整体输入的平方，与题目右边比较。</p><p>把右边写成整体输入的组合，再用 t 统一替换。</p><p>检查整体输入能取的范围，将解析式和范围一起写出。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-complete-square/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>配方</a></li><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/skill-simplify/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>代数式化简</a></li><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/skill-equality-transform/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>等式变形与推导</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"verify\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><h3>独立核验规则与覆盖</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#verify\" aria-label=\"定位到独立核验规则与覆盖\">#</a></div><p>同时核对原关系恒等、输入像集、端点归属和目标所要求的范围。</p></li></ol></section><section id=\"basis\"><h2>背后用到的知识</h2><p class=\"muted\">上面各步骤用到的性质和公式。做一道具体的题，通常只用到其中一部分。</p><div class=\"chips\"><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/equality-properties/#addition\">等式的性质 · 同加同减</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/equality-properties/#identity\">等式的性质 · 等值替换与定义域</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/equality-properties/#multiplication\">等式的性质 · 同乘与非零同除</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/square-nonnegative/#nonnegative\">平方的非负性 · 平方非负</a></div></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>例题</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 直接配凑平方</h3><p class=\"problem\">已知 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x-\\frac{1}{x})=x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\">